    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n98686" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμ-πηκτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put together, constructed,
				framed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκήματα ς. ἐξ ἀνθερίκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.190
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλαίσια ξ</span>.
			<i>compact</i>, 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύμπτυκτα</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				800
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>curdled</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. γάλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philox.
					2.36
				</span></i>
			.</div>
